silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_01_gate_discipline_sections_01_source_witness_ingestion_decomposition_step_1__step_forge_morphism_for_01_source_witness_ingestion a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RawWitness is the incoming source packet before any Forge handling — for example, the vet-record file about Mittens before we decide what typed role it occupies. CitedObject is the same packet after a citation key is assigned. LocalInfo is the interpreted content, a paraphrase stating the Mittens-relevant claim. OlogNode is the typed node assigned in the local category F_04. ForgeLeg is the node's position as a source leg in D_Mittens." .
